OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Wrexham player calls for more
OL,4,Asupport for youngsters released by
OL,5,Aclubs
OL,6,
OL,7,FA young footballer has described the
OL,8,Fimpact on his mental health after
OL,9,Ffailing to secure a professional
OL,10,Fcontract, calling for greater support
OL,11,Ffor others who may be "struggling".
OL,13,FHari Roberts said hearing at the age of
OL,14,F18 that he would not get a deal with
OL,15,FWrexham AFC was a "big shock to the
OL,16,Fsystem".
OL,18,FHe said it led to a difficult period as
OL,19,Ffootball had been his main goal since
OL,20,Fchildhood, representing Wales and
OL,21,Fsigning for Wrexham at 14.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
